        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Spacious 3-Bedroom bungalow for rent\n\n. This beautifully presented three-bedroom bungalow is set on a large private site, offering peace and privacy in a lovely countryside setting. The property is fully furnished throughout and ready for immediate occupancy. Conveniently located just a 7-minute drive from Morriscastle Beach and 25 minutes from Gorey Town, it provides the perfect balance of coastal and rural living.\n\nKey Features:\n\n•3 spacious bedrooms\n\n•Fully furnished throughout\n\n•Large private site\n\n•Peaceful setting close to the beach\n\n•Only 25 minutes to Gorey Town\n\nPlease note: Garage not included."
